POST {{host}}/api/v1/community/memos
Content-Type: application/json
Anonymous-User-UUID: not-a-uuid

{
  "sourceType": "DIRECT",
  "originalFileId": "{{originalFileId}}",
  "thumbnailFileId": "{{thumbnailFileId}}",
  "positionX": 0.0,
  "positionY": 0.0,
  "zIndex": 1,
  "rotationDeg": 0.0
}

### Create community memo - missing source gallery
POST {{host}}/api/v1/community/memos
Content-Type: application/json
Anonymous-User-UUID: {{anonymousUserUuid}}

{
  "sourceType": "GALLERY",
  "originalFileId": "{{originalFileId}}",
  "thumbnailFileId": "{{thumbnailFileId}}",
  "positionX": 0.0,
  "positionY": 0.0,
  "zIndex": 1,
  "rotationDeg": 0.0
}

### Create community memo - moderation may block
# FastAPI moderation can return 400 before DB insert if the final snapshot is not allowed.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/community/memos
Content-Type: application/json
Anonymous-User-UUID: {{anonymousUserUuid}}

{
  "sourceType": "DIRECT",
  "originalFileId": "{{originalFileId}}",
  "thumbnailFileId": "{{thumbnailFileId}}",
  "positionX": 0.0,
  "positionY": 0.0,
  "zIndex": 1,
  "rotationDeg": 0.0,
  "clientText": "모더레이션 차단 테스트 문구"
}
